# Community Gaming Regulation

## Part 2: Permitted gaming activities


<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_social_housie:b0003; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_social_housie:p0001; source-lines: 2-4; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala-metadata
```


### 5 Housie or bingo

#### (3) Social housie

Social housie is a permitted gaming activity for the purposes of section 10 of
the Act if the following requirements are complied with—

(a) the gaming activity is conducted solely for social purposes,

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_social_housie:b0004; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_social_housie:p0002; source-lines: 7-14; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```


(b) the gaming activity is not conducted on premises to which a licence
under theLiquor Act 2007 relates,

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_social_housie:b0005; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_social_housie:p0003; source-lines: 16-17; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```


(c) except as provided by paragraph (d), the total value of all of the
 available prizes for 1 session of the gaming activity does not exceed $40,

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_social_housie:b0006; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_social_housie:p0004; source-lines: 19-20; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```


(d) if 1 or more individual prizes are not won, the value of any jackpot prize
does not exceed $200,

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_social_housie:b0007; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_social_housie:p0005; source-lines: 22-23; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```


(e) the total amount invested by participants in a session of the gaming
activity,after the costs of prizes and expenses of conducting the session are
deducted,is returned to participants.

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_social_housie:b0008; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_social_housie:p0006; source-lines: 25-27; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```

